==Battleground==
*1 [[Gold Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*6 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Golden Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 5~6.67 seconds<sup>150f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Pure Gold R.Ost]] spawns as the boss.
**9 [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Golden Doge]]s spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Pure Gold R.Ost makes this stage somewhat more difficult than the previous ones, but should still be fairly simple with decently powered units. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] at a decent level as well as any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] to make the Pure Gold R.Ost more manageable.

==Trivia==
*Golden Age's Dawn's Japanese name, Travel Agency Bankruptcy, may be referring to [[wikipedia:ja:てるみくらぶ|Tellmeclub Inc.]], a cheap travel agency that went bankrupt almost precisely 1 month before [[GOLD RUSH#The Midas Touch|The Midas Touch]] was first released.

